      "text": "LEGIT: images/legitimate-image/app.js\nclean container app entrypoint · ✓ No collector POST · ✓ No TESTBENCH gated exfil · normal Dockerfile CMD\nMAL: images/compromised-image/malicious-start.js\nanonymous top-level ·   if (TESTBENCH_MODE !== 'enabled') exit ·   hostname: SCAS_MOCK_HOST || 127.0.0.1 ·   port: SCAS_MOCK_PORT || 3002 ·   path: '/capture'\nedge: image CMD ≠ source app",
