      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "text": "setup: source enable-testbench.sh →   → TESTBENCH_MODE=enabled → build images/compromised-image → start mock-server.js :3002 → run container with TESTBENCH_MODE\nmock: node infrastructure/mock-server.js · listen http://localhost:3002 · init captured-data.json {captures:[]} · POST /capture · GET /captured-data · (Docker may use host.docker.internal)\nlab: docker build compromised-image · docker run -e TESTBENCH_MODE=enabled … ·   → malicious-start.js POST /capture\nsteps: 1. Learner→Victim: TESTBENCH_MODE=enabled node images/compromised-image/malicious-start.js · 2. Victim→MalPkg: Compromised image layer / entrypoint runs · 3. MalPkg→MalPkg: Simulated container startup exfil stub · 4. Learner→Victim: (Optional) docker run scas-compromised image",
